ll swoop. Eliminating worlds and their defenders at a quick pace awards you with newer and even better weapons and the upgrades for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another Tip: Better Loot makes for Better Killing. But of course, you knew that already didn't you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086140/extras/653dcbeef8156e427c9b536723091d40.avif?t=1734718785\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086140/extras/0f9a551f29a3b4b6965bde08d1c74c9f.poster.avif?t=1734718785\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086140/extras/0f9a551f29a3b4b6965bde08d1c74c9f.webm?t=1734718785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086140/extras/0f9a551f29a3b4b6965bde08d1c74c9f.mp4?t=1734718785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run completed by Not Dying and collecting Meta-Currency\u2122 means even more options for the next one. Every card unlocked works on every weapon, synergises upgrades to create powerful builds, and offers the metaphorical sky as the limit (until you literally blow it away with the planet it\u2019s on). We don\u2019t do petty balancing or tweaking single numbers here. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repetitive Indie Combat Experience is all about distilling combat to its rawest, purest form, stripping everything that gets in the way - including limits on your ability to destroy. Nothing will stand between you and your R.I.C.E. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Tip: Give into your primal desire to end lives and watch numbers go up.</p>","developers":["Pirate-Rob"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086140/header.jpg?t=1734718785","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Pirate-Rob &  Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2086140/558758/a60026fdb5c9be188d0b4daea3d59e02024250f0/1751073709/dash_av1.mpd?t=1681748445","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2086140/558758/a60026fdb5c9be188d0b4daea3d59e02024250f0/1751073709/dash_h264.mpd?t=1681748445","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2086140/558758/a60026fdb5c9be188d0b4daea3d59e02024250f0/1751073709/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1681748445","id":256941671,"name":"EA RDA Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256941671/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1681748445"}],"name":"RICE - Repetitive Indie Combat Experience\u2122","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"RICE - Repetitive Indie Combat Experience\u2122 - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99</span> $3.99 USD","packageid":745506,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":399}],"title":"Buy RICE - Repetitive Indie Combat Experience\u2122"}],"packages":[745506],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 10/7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Processor<br></li><li><s